Now I have all the information I need. The iron pickaxe has mining level 2, which is sufficient to mine emerald blocks (which require iron tier or higher). The emerald block drops itself when mined with an appropriate pickaxe.

Based on the scene design and verified mechanics, here are my milestone rules:

